    },
    "en": {
      "subtitle": "interactive novel",
      "heading": "PROTOCOL READY TO START",
      "paragraphs": [
        "By continuing, you confirm that you are a living human being.",
        "The author does not need your personal data. We do not ask for your name, email address, or registration. Only anonymized interaction events and the time at which they occur are retained, exclusively for statistical purposes.",
